  "source": "## Goal\n\nPrint a **greeting** and the *sum* $a+b$, for amounts like $5 and $10. Details in the [spec](https://example.org/spec)[^1].\n\n| Test | Points |\n| :--- | ---: |\n| `compiles` | 3 |\n| ~~prints hi~~ prints hello | 5 |\n\n- [x] Read the spec\n- [ ] Run the tests\n\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^n i = n(n+1)/2\n$$\n\n> Late work counts, marked late.\n\n[^1]: Also on the course page.\n"
